# Long realm-vs-realm /faction threads for any realm: keep raids, door defense, siege, relics, DF,
# realm points, groups and battlegrounds. Realm-specific names come from slots ({keep}, {frontier},
# {enemy}, {capital}, {realm}). New writing; period knowledge from the research brief.

@kind debate
@realm *

@topic keep_raid_plan
@levels 35-50
@scene rvr_keep_raid_plan
@role B type=NoLifer
@role C type=Daredevil
@role D type=Socialite
@role E type=Crafter
A: {q} who wants to take a keep tonight? we have been sitting at home all week | ok real talk, when did we last take a keep that wasnt ours already
B: depends which one. the closest {enemy} keep has half their realm parked next to it | which keep tho. the near ones get defended in two minutes
C: hit the far one. by the time they notice we are inside | go deep, nobody watches the back keeps at this hour
B: deep means a very long walk home if it goes wrong
C: walking is half the fun | then dont die :P | so dont lose
~ 25
D: i am in, give me a few to grab my stuff from the bank | count me in, just finishing a quest turn in
A: need numbers first. how many can we get without begging
?D: my guild has maybe six on, let me ask them | i can poke my guild, a few of them look bored
B: we need two rams or we are knocking with our fists | without rams we are just tourists with swords
E: i have a ram built, never used it | got a ram in my bags from last week, still shiny
E: someone else carry it though, i would get one step from the door and drop dead
C: i will carry it, i am faster than you anyway
~ 30
A: ok so far thats... eleven? twelve? | headcount looks like a dozen give or take
B: enough for the door, not enough if they show up with a real defense | a dozen takes a door, not a counterattack
D: we just leave a couple on the hill to watch the road
?C: or we bring a speed class and run if it turns ugly
A: so when do we go
B: half an hour, meet at {keep} | thirty minutes, gather at {keep} and dont wander off
?D: does a keep lord drop anything good? | is the lord worth killing for loot or just the realm points
B: realm points and bragging rights mostly
D: bragging rights it is then
~ 40
E: ram is at {keep}, i set it by the gate | left the ram by the gate at {keep}, try not to trip over it
C: who is calling targets once we are in | someone has to lead inside or we will spread out on every stair
A: i will call, everyone /assist me when the guards come | i will lead, stay tight and assist me
C: ok boss
D: on my way, two minutes | omw, saddling up

